@@ -3,3 +3,12 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` creates an isolated in-memory rental service. Register each board or sail with
+`addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`, where money is an integer number of euro cents. `quote()`
+prices a request and `book()` reserves it; both accept `{ itemId, start, end }` and require UTC
+ISO-8601 timestamps at midnight. Rental periods are start-inclusive and end-exclusive, so the end is
+the midnight following the final rental day. A booking cannot overlap an existing booking for the same
+item. Cancellation is not implemented yet.
