+---
+id: task-001-add-rental-service
+type: task
+title: "Add rental service"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement the initial in-memory rental service for the booking desk.
+
+The public API must export `createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts`, support registering boards
+and sails, quoting and booking whole UTC days, reject invalid/unknown/unavailable requests, and use
+integer euro cents.  Cancellation is explicitly out of scope, though its policy is retained as a
+future requirement.
